 comprehensive. Ensure that Step 7 (Residual Analysis) is used to specifically highlight the transition region between the 1-halo and 2-halo terms, as this is where the Neyman-Scott kernel is most likely to show deviations from the HOD\'s actual spatial distribution.\n\nThe plan is now well-aligned with the feedback and provides a clear path to scientifically meaningful results. No further structural changes are required.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='0fc7bb37-4ca7-4dff-97fd-60368f1ae785'



